    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA magnificent A-Rated three-bedroom detached residence, set in magnificent surroundings with breathtaking countryside views and maximum sun exposure.\nThe Glasshouse enjoys a truly exceptional hilltop setting on circa 1.2 acres of land with fabulous panoramic views over the surrounding countryside. This is a rare opportunity to acquire a striking home with immense potential, ready for its next owner to complete and finish to their own taste and specification.\nCurrently at builder's fix stage, the property presents a wonderful blank canvas for the discerning purchaser. The layout has been designed to accommodate three bedrooms (as per planning), a large well-proportioned living space and a substantial garage, allowing the new owner the exciting opportunity to tailor finishes, fittings and interior styling to suit their own vision. With its elevated aspect and generous site, the house is ideally positioned to maximise natural light and take full advantage of the stunning outlook, enhanced by floor-to-ceiling NorDan windows and doors with the highest possible certification for security.\nInternally, the home is envisioned as a bright and contemporary living space featuring barn inspired exposed timber uprights and beams within the bright white space, creating a seamless balance of warmth and modern design. The layout incorporates a spacious open-plan kitchen/dining/living area, designed for both everyday living and entertaining.\nStanding on a generous plot, the property occupies an enviable hilltop position that offers both total privacy and seclusion and a wonderful sense of space. The grounds provide ample room for landscaping, gardens and outdoor living, while the elevated location frames the surrounding countryside beautifully. The plot encompasses two folios, with the ruins of an old cottage sitting on the second, offering potential for development of the site. The fabulous views are a defining feature of this home and, combined with no light pollution, create a special sense of calm and uninterrupted night skies.\nThe property has been carefully designed as a low energy passive A1 eco house steeped in sustainability, incorporating an array of energy-efficient features. It further benefits from private well water and is built with quality materials including Blue Bangor Natural Slate roofing finish.\nA double-door garage provides excellent storage and practical space, complementing the overall scale and functionality of the home. Despite its tranquil and rural setting, the property remains exceptionally well connected with 5Gb fibre optic broadband, allowing for modern remote working and seamless connectivity.\nLocated in the scenic surrounds of Avoca, this property enjoys the best of country living while remaining accessible to local amenities, village services and the many natural attractions for which the area is renowned. Avoca is celebrated for its charm, heritage and beautiful landscape, making it an increasingly popular choice for those seeking a tranquil lifestyle within County Wicklow.\nThe Glasshouse represents a superb opportunity to complete and personalise a unique detached home in an outstanding setting. With its generous site, elevated position and breathtaking views, this is a property of enormous promise that must be seen to be fully appreciated. Viewings strictly by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>· Impressive three-bedroom A rated detached home </li><li>· Air to water heat pump </li><li>· Underfloor heating </li><li>· Biocycle System and Well Water </li><li>· Solar Panels </li><li>· At builder's fix stage, offering scope to personalise the final finish </li><li>· Large garage providing excellent storage or workshop potential </li><li>· Set on approximately one acre of elevated land </li><li>· Commanding hilltop position with fabulous views </li><li>· Peaceful countryside setting within easy reach of Avoca village </li><li>· A unique opportunity to create a superb family home or countryside retreat</li><li>Strictly By Appointment</ul>"
      },
